{"2375530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Descenders Next", "steam_appid": 2375530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to conquer the world of extreme sports. This is Descenders Next. Grab your snowboard and tackle the steep, snowy slopes, or tear up the harsh, lush terrain with your mountainboard! Feel like taking on the challenge with a squad? Match up with your friends and Descenders players all around the world, and take on the tracks together! The mountain is calling - will you master it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.poster.avif?t=1772552499\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.webm?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.mp4?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A re-imagining of extreme sports, Descenders style</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride your way, every way</u>: Find your own path and attack the mountain in style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride solo or multiplayer</u>: Be a lone wolf, or join players all around the world in grinding for those points </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Freestyle board controls</u>: Control every subtle movement of your rider, with in-depth physics and trick systems to learn and master </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Showcase your skills</u>: Keep and show off your incredible plays - you've got all the tools you need to make the best edits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Build your reputation</u>: A fully-featured character customizer and rep system so you can unlock new threads, gear and boards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride to banger after banger</u>: Descend in style to the perfect soundtrack from Monstercat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Become the next Descender</u>: Complete all the challenges the world has to offer, and reach the ranks of the legendary Descenders!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.poster.avif?t=1772552499\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.webm?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.mp4?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds, experience different jumps and slopes every time you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss jumps at the end of each world. Can you beat them all?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as much REP as you can in a session to unlock new gear!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brand New Parks:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descenders Next brings a set of all new, high octane parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races, Slopestyles and Parks: Each park brings unique gameplay, catering to your playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new environments, while enjoying the familiar Descenders thrill.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A park for everyone - find your favourites and jump in with your friends! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customisation than ever before - make your rider your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole new library of unique gear sets, from common to extraordinary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new types of gear, including gear from very real brands.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to conquer the world of extreme sports. This is Descenders Next. Grab your snowboard and tackle the steep, snowy slopes, or tear up the harsh, lush terrain with your mountainboard! Feel like taking on the challenge with a squad? Match up with your friends and Descenders players all around the world, and take on the tracks together! The mountain is calling - will you master it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.poster.avif?t=1772552499\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.webm?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/f0ec51422781260d36ba7cdeeb46ef3c.mp4?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A re-imagining of extreme sports, Descenders style</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride your way, every way</u>: Find your own path and attack the mountain in style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride solo or multiplayer</u>: Be a lone wolf, or join players all around the world in grinding for those points </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Freestyle board controls</u>: Control every subtle movement of your rider, with in-depth physics and trick systems to learn and master </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Showcase your skills</u>: Keep and show off your incredible plays - you've got all the tools you need to make the best edits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Build your reputation</u>: A fully-featured character customizer and rep system so you can unlock new threads, gear and boards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ride to banger after banger</u>: Descend in style to the perfect soundtrack from Monstercat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Become the next Descender</u>: Complete all the challenges the world has to offer, and reach the ranks of the legendary Descenders!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.poster.avif?t=1772552499\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.webm?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375530/extras/efe796c58ef2b5ce1709ee5df9da2d23.mp4?t=1772552499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds, experience different jumps and slopes every time you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss jumps at the end of each world. Can you beat them all?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as much REP as you can in a session to unlock new gear!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brand New Parks:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descenders Next brings a set of all new, high octane parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races, Slopestyles and Parks: Each park brings unique gameplay, catering to your playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new environments, while enjoying the familiar Descenders thrill.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A park for everyone - find your favourites and jump in with your friends! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customisation than ever before - make your rider your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole new library of unique gear sets, from common to extraordinary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new types of gear, including gear from very real brands.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Grab your board and master the mountain! Descenders Next is the ultimate extreme sports game, with sprawling snowy peaks, winding dirt tracks, and tons of parks to conquer. Will you and your friends become the Next Ultimate Descenders?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“With Descenders Next, the primal videogame pleasure of going really fast dow